{"id":491,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"英語とキリスト教教育で人間性を育む","feature_description":"神戸女学院はキリスト教に基づく全人教育を行い、毎朝の礼拝を通して生き方を見つめます。中学部では原則として授業を英語で行い、1年生の英語授業では週6時間中3時間を国際教員とのペアティーチングに充てます。岡田山の自然とヴォーリズ建築を生かした環境のもと、生徒主体の学校生活と特色ある英語教育を柱に、コミュニケーション力や異文化理解を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":14292,"name":"E.S.S.","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14293,"name":"演劇研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14294,"name":"家庭科研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14295,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14296,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14297,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14298,"name":"ギター部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14299,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14300,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14301,"name":"コンピュータ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14302,"name":"漫画・イラスト研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14303,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobejogakuin-h.ed.jp/seikatsu/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14304,"name":"